---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/IssaLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout footer="none" title="Tea Selection | Issa Green Tea" description="Tea Selection | Issa Green Tea">
<!-- ══ SENCHA ══ -->
  <section class="tea-section">
    <div class="page">
      <div class="tea-header">
        <h2 class="tea-header-name">Sencha</h2>
        <p class="tea-header-sub">Green tea</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tea-layout" id="tea-sencha">
        <div class="tea-visual">
          <div class="botanical-wrap">
            <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-1.jpg" alt="Sencha" class="tea-photo">
          </div>
          <div class="buy-btn-wrap">
            <a href="/shop" class="buy-btn">Buy this tea</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tea-info">
          <h2 class="tea-variety-name">Fukamushi sencha</h2>
          <div class="farm-line">
            <span class="farm-name">Sugimoto farm</span>
            <span class="farm-loc">in Shizuoka</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag tag-grey">Health&amp;Beauty</span>
            <span class="tag tag-sage">Regular caffeine</span>
            <span class="tag tag-yellow">Rich flavor</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tea-desc">ISSA GREEN's signature tea.</p><p class="tea-desc">This sencha is produced by steaming leaves two to three times longer than regular varieties — creating a uniquely rich, smooth cup.</p>
          <hr class="divider">
          
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'sencha')">
          <span class="acc-label">More about Fukamushi Sencha</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p>The steaming process makes tea leaves finer, and insoluble nutrition (fiber, protein,
      β-carotene, vitamin E, chlorophyll and minerals) is released from the powdery part of the tea.</p>
      <p>Rich in catechin, vitamin C, vitamin B2, tannin, flavonoid, gamma-aminobutyric acid,
      pectin, saponin, polysaccharide, fluorine and caffeine.</p>
      <p>We recommend a cup of fukamushi tea in the morning for immune support and a beauty booster!</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'sencha')">
          <span class="acc-label">How to Brew</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p class="brew-amount">1 tsp / 250–500 ml</p>
      <p>Hot: 80°C · 1 min &nbsp;·&nbsp; Cold brew: 2–4 hours or overnight</p>
      <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-2.jpg" alt="Sencha brewed" class="brew-img"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'sencha')">
          <span class="acc-label">Product Details</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Organic green tea</p>
      <p><strong>Producer:</strong> Sugimoto farm</p>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-3.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Loose tea &nbsp;&nbsp; 60 g</span></div>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-4.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Tea bag &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 g × 20</span></div>
      <div class="prod-row"><span>– Tea powder &nbsp;50 g</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- ══ GYOKURO ══ -->
  <section class="tea-section" style="background:#f0ede6;">
    <div class="page">
      <div class="tea-header">
        <h2 class="tea-header-name">Gyokuro</h2>
        <p class="tea-header-sub">Shaded green tea</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tea-layout" id="tea-gyokuro">
        <div class="tea-visual">
          <div class="botanical-wrap">
            <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-5.jpg" alt="Gyokuro" class="tea-photo">
          </div>
          <div class="buy-btn-wrap">
            <a href="/shop" class="buy-btn">Buy this tea</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tea-info">
          <h2 class="tea-variety-name">Gyokuro <span class="tea-pill">Limited Item</span></h2>
          <div class="farm-line">
            <span class="farm-name">Ishikawa farm</span>
            <span class="farm-loc">in Toyota, Aichi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag tag-grey">Health&amp;Beauty</span>
            <span class="tag tag-sage">Energy boost</span>
            <span class="tag tag-yellow">Rich umami</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tea-desc">Known as Jade Dew — made with the same tea leaves as matcha, shaded and protected from sunlight. Superior hand-plucked tea with more umami and natural sweetness.</p><p class="tea-desc">We have only a limited amount every season. Contains more caffeine compared to regular sencha.</p>
          <hr class="divider">
          
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'gyokuro')">
          <span class="acc-label">How to Brew</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p class="brew-amount">2 tbsp / 80–100 ml</p>
      <p>Cold brew: 0.5–1 hour</p>
      <p class="brew-note">*We recommend filtered water or bottled soft water, and brewing at proper temperature for this delicate tea.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'gyokuro')">
          <span class="acc-label">Product Details</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Organic green tea</p>
      <p><strong>Producer:</strong> Suzuki farm</p>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-6.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Loose tea &nbsp;&nbsp; 40 g</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- ══ GENMAICHA ══ -->
  <section class="tea-section">
    <div class="page">
      <div class="tea-header">
        <h2 class="tea-header-name">Genmaicha</h2>
        <p class="tea-header-sub">Green tea with Brown rice</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tea-layout" id="tea-genmaicha">
        <div class="tea-visual">
          <div class="botanical-wrap">
            <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-7.jpg" alt="Genmaicha" class="tea-photo">
          </div>
          <div class="buy-btn-wrap">
            <a href="/shop" class="buy-btn">Buy this tea</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tea-info">
          <h2 class="tea-variety-name">Fukamushi genmaicha</h2>
          <div class="farm-line">
            <span class="farm-name">Sugimoto farm</span>
            <span class="farm-loc">in Shizuoka</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag tag-grey">Diet</span>
            <span class="tag tag-sage">Low caffeine</span>
            <span class="tag tag-yellow">Crispy flavor</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tea-desc">This is ISSA GREEN's most popular tea.</p><p class="tea-desc">This genmaicha is made from fukamushi sencha and brown rice, both grown by same organic farmer. This variety softens the bitterness of green tea with its unique crispy flavor.</p>
          <hr class="divider">
          
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'genmaicha')">
          <span class="acc-label">More about Fukamushi Genmaicha</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p>The sweetness and starch from the popped brown rice have a filling quality that helps avoid
      overeating — making genmaicha perfect for meals and snacks.</p>
      <p>Zero calorie drink. Fukamushi genmaicha contains less caffeine compared to regular sencha.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'genmaicha')">
          <span class="acc-label">How to Brew</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p class="brew-amount">1 tsp / 250–500 ml</p>
      <p>Hot: 80°C · 1 min &nbsp;·&nbsp; Cold brew: 2–4 hours or overnight</p>
      <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-8.jpg" alt="Genmaicha brewed" class="brew-img"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'genmaicha')">
          <span class="acc-label">Product Details</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Organic green tea, Brown rice</p>
      <p><strong>Producer:</strong> Sugimoto farm</p>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-9.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Loose tea &nbsp;&nbsp; 60 g</span></div>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-10.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Tea bag &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 g × 20</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- ══ MATCHA ══ -->
  <section class="tea-section" style="background:#f0ede6;">
    <div class="page">
      <div class="tea-header">
        <h2 class="tea-header-name">Matcha</h2>
        <p class="tea-header-sub">Japanese Ceremonial tea</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tea-layout" id="tea-matcha">
        <div class="tea-visual">
          <div class="botanical-wrap">
            <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-11.jpg" alt="Matcha" class="tea-photo">
          </div>
          <div class="buy-btn-wrap">
            <a href="/shop" class="buy-btn">Buy this tea</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tea-info">
          <h2 class="tea-variety-name">Matcha <span class="tea-pill">Most Popular</span></h2>
          <div class="farm-line">
            <span class="farm-name">Ishikawa farm</span>
            <span class="farm-loc">in Toyota, Aichi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag tag-grey">Health&amp;Beauty</span>
            <span class="tag tag-sage">Energy boost</span>
            <span class="tag tag-yellow">Rich flavor</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tea-desc">Because it is difficult to obtain genuine matcha outside of Japan, we are especially proud to offer this genuine matcha grown by a specialist farmer using organic methods.</p><p class="tea-desc">Available in two ceremonial grades — both significantly superior to culinary grade.</p>
          <hr class="divider">
          
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'matcha')">
          <span class="acc-label">More about Matcha</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p>We carry two ceremonial grades (not culinary grade!). Ceremonial matcha has richness,
      maturity and a slight natural sweetness. Fine matcha has freshness, bold character and clear
      bitterness — excellent for lattes.</p>
      <p>Matcha is known as a Japanese super food: rich in catechin, β-carotene, vitamin E, K,
      B vitamins, vitamin C, folic acid, niacin and minerals. Popular for immune support and
      anti-aging worldwide.</p>
      <p>Called the Japanese espresso — high in caffeine, great for starting your day.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'matcha')">
          <span class="acc-label">How to Brew</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p class="brew-amount">1 tsp / 70–100 ml</p>
      <p>For sweetness, brew at lower temperature.</p>
      <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-12.jpg" alt="Matcha preparation" class="brew-img"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'matcha')">
          <span class="acc-label">Product Details</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Organic green tea</p>
      <p><strong>Producer:</strong> Ishikawa farm</p>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-13.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Ceremonial quality &nbsp; 30 g</span></div>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-14.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Fine quality &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;30 g</span></div>
      <p class="brew-note">*We don't use canned packaging to reduce CO₂ emissions.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- ══ HOUJICHA ══ -->
  <section class="tea-section">
    <div class="page">
      <div class="tea-header">
        <h2 class="tea-header-name">Houjicha</h2>
        <p class="tea-header-sub">Roasted green tea</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tea-layout" id="tea-houjicha">
        <div class="tea-visual">
          <div class="botanical-wrap">
            <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-15.jpg" alt="Houjicha" class="tea-photo">
          </div>
          <div class="buy-btn-wrap">
            <a href="/shop" class="buy-btn">Buy this tea</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tea-info">
          <h2 class="tea-variety-name">Houjicha</h2>
          <div class="farm-line">
            <span class="farm-name">Suzuki farm</span>
            <span class="farm-loc">in Shinshiro, Aichi</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag tag-grey">Relaxing</span>
            <span class="tag tag-sage">Low caffeine</span>
            <span class="tag tag-yellow">Crispy flavor</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tea-desc">Houjicha is a roasted green tea with a unique aroma and mild taste.</p><p class="tea-desc">Grown and roasted by the same farm — it has both freshness and a crispy flavour. Lower in caffeine and tannin than regular green tea. Also excellent in lattes, cookies and cakes.</p>
          <hr class="divider">
          
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'houjicha')">
          <span class="acc-label">How to Brew</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p class="brew-amount">1 tbsp / 250–500 ml</p>
      <img src="/images/tea-selection/img-16.jpg" alt="Houjicha in a cup" class="brew-img"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-header" onclick="toggleAcc(this,'houjicha')">
          <span class="acc-label">Product Details</span>
          <span class="acc-icon">+</span>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-body">
          <div class="acc-content">
      <p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Organic roasted green tea</p>
      <p><strong>Producer:</strong> Suzuki farm</p>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-17.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Loose tea &nbsp;&nbsp; 80 g</span></div>
      <div class="prod-row"><img src="/images/tea-selection/img-18.png" alt="Organic" class="organic-logo"><span>– Tea bags &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 g × 20</span></div>
      <div class="prod-row"><span>– Tea powder &nbsp;50 g</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
<script is:inline>
    // Accordion: opens downward, never pushes page up.
    // Closing snaps max-height to 0 — content collapses below, not above.
    function toggleAcc(header, teaId) {
      const isOpen = header.classList.contains('open');

      // Close all accordions in THIS tea section only
      const section = document.getElementById('tea-' + teaId);
      section.querySelectorAll('.acc-header.open').forEach(h => {
        h.classList.remove('open');
        h.nextElementSibling.classList.remove('open');
      });

      // If it was closed, open it (scroll position unchanged — content grows downward)
      if (!isOpen) {
        header.classList.add('open');
        header.nextElementSibling.classList.add('open');
      }
    }
  </script>
</SiteLayout>

<style is:global>


    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --ink:      #1C2B1A;
      --sage:     #7A9B6E;
      --slate:    #748092;
      --offwhite: #FAFAF7;
      --mid:      #5C5C5C;
      --light:    #8F8F8F;
      --rule:     rgba(28,43,26,0.12);
      --display:  'Amiri', Georgia, serif;
      --body:     'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      --ease:     cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
      --max:      1200px;
      --pad:      clamp(24px, 5vw, 80px);
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: var(--body);
      background: var(--offwhite);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 300;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
    a   { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

    /* ─── PAGE WRAPPER ─────────────────────────── */
    .page {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(24px, 5vw, 72px);
    }

    /* ─── TEA SECTION HEADER ──────────────────── */
    /* "Genmaicha" big heading + rule + subtitle */
    .tea-header {
      margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px);
    }
    .tea-header-name {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--mid);
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      line-height: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    /* The long horizontal rule extending right of the name */
    .tea-header-name::after {
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--rule);
      margin-left: 4px;
    }
    .tea-header-sub {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 22px);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--light);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding-left: 2px;
    }

    /* ─── MAIN LAYOUT ─────────────────────────── */
    /* ─── LAYOUT ───────────────────────────────── */
    .tea-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
      gap: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px);
      align-items: start;
    }

    /* LEFT: image + button — left aligned on tablet/desktop */
    .tea-visual {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .botanical-wrap {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    /* Circle photo — fixed 220px, never scales */
    .tea-photo {
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 1px solid rgba(28,43,26,0.1);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(28,43,26,0.10);
      display: block;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Buy button — width matches photo, centered under it */
    .buy-btn-wrap {
      width: 220px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .buy-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 220px;
      text-align: center;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(28,43,26,0.2);
      color: var(--mid);
      padding: 10px 0;
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .buy-btn:hover {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--ink);
    }

    /* ─── RIGHT: INFO PANEL ───────────────────── */
    .tea-info {}

    /* Sub-variety name */
    .tea-variety-name {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 46px);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    /* Farm + location inline */
    .farm-line {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .farm-name {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: clamp(17px, 1.8vw, 21px);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--mid);
    }
    .farm-loc {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: clamp(13px, 1.3vw, 16px);
      color: var(--light);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    /* Tag badges — exactly as in the screenshot */
    .tags {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .tag {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 400;
      padding: 5px 18px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .tag-grey   { background: #dcdde0; color: #5a5a6a; }
    .tag-sage   { background: #d8edcc; color: #4a7a3a; }
    .tag-yellow { background: #f0ed98; color: #5a5820; }

    /* Pill badge for LIMITED ITEM / MOST POPULAR — sits inline beside the name */
    .tea-pill {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--body);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 7px 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(28,43,26,0.15);
      background: #f5f3ee;
      color: var(--mid);
      vertical-align: middle;
      margin-left: 16px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* Description text */
    .tea-desc {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 20px);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .tea-desc + .tea-desc {
      color: var(--mid);
      font-size: clamp(15px, 1.5vw, 18px);
    }

    /* Divider before accordion */
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      margin: 28px 0 0;
    }

    /* Accordion */
    .acc-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .acc-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
